msgid "Turn the shape into the reference shape of the project."
msgstr "Convierte la forma en la forma de referencia del proyecto."

#: res/xrc/OutfitStudio.xrc:2442 res/xrc/OutfitStudio.xrc:2958
msgid "Move..."
msgstr "Mover..."

#: res/xrc/OutfitStudio.xrc:2443 res/xrc/OutfitStudio.xrc:2959
msgid "Apply an offset adjustment to the mesh vertices. This permanently moves vertices."
msgstr "Aplica un ajuste de desplazamiento a los vértices de la malla. Esto mueve permanentemente los vértices."

#: res/xrc/OutfitStudio.xrc:2446 res/xrc/OutfitStudio.xrc:2962
msgid "Scale..."
msgstr "Escalar..."

