msgid "Inflate..."
msgstr "Inflar..."

#: res/xrc/OutfitStudio.xrc:2455 res/xrc/OutfitStudio.xrc:2971
msgid "Inflates/deflates a shape along its normals. This permanently moves vertices."
msgstr "Infla/desinfla una forma a lo largo de sus normales. Esto mueve permanentemente los vértices."

